# Guitar Freaks 4th Mix (G*A24 VER. JAA): a game, from what gtrfrk4m-install.his left (the flash
# and the PC Card installed; the game cassette in). The first boot says the RTC RAM was cleared
# (NOTE 605) and goes on; the title is at frame ~5,000. Two coins, Start through the screens to
# the music select's default; the stage played with the guitar: every 12 frames a neck button held
# and picked (R, G, B in turn), a wail every 240. Hashes the main RAM every frame, snapshots every
# 60 frames, to compare with MAME.
game gtrfrk4m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 5500 press "Coin 1" 8
at 5540 press "Coin 1" 8
at 5700 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 6000 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 6300 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 6600 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 6900 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 7200 every 36 press "P1 Button R" 8
from 7212 every 36 press "P1 Button G" 8
from 7224 every 36 press "P1 Button B" 8
from 7202 every 12 press "P1 Pick" 3
from 7206 every 240 press "P1 Wailing" 4
from 0 every 60 snap
at 15000 quit
